0" height="691" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1523</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1523</guid><pubDate>Sun, 21 Dec 2025 08:05:34 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Tiny Tiny RSS 作者将停止维护该项目</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tiny Tiny RSS 作者将停止维护该项目&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;项目作者在 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1522?q=%23TTRSS"&gt;#TTRSS&lt;/a&gt; 官方论坛发布：&lt;a href="https://community.tt-rss.org/t/the-end-of-tt-rss-org/7164" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;The end of tt-rss.org&lt;/a&gt;，宣布11月1日终止该项目。目前已有项目贡献者 fork 源码、插件、文档等并转载至 GitHub ，且愿意接棒项目开发和运维：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/tt-rss/tt-rss" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/tt-rss/tt-rss&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/JeffreyCalm/status/1977632807418745277" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://x.com/JeffreyCalm/status/1977632807418745277&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/U92-EtlRFn_lyREfMunoty3XKOrCPfYeTf4N2WUqKpmiMTe4Abh2dCNNBjgUNW5blPoWH31QZNai7tCArFB7p8G7z2eC9wsLBxXEUKiUvX5ajxzhe7hWFiRAymPZ0ueHo3edUkWqHNTJOc18FLCP21bvboUo1dHSMCKnt4txUtFA3pX15lbJJiBPHtl9SOVCRELpeWIEJvNXHwhSZ4ww95LKUlu929r8wGaCIX_V3VGXVMjl0flG1oSpZDTyBbmBw1q0Dpu1s2sLjOfBibcmUS4CJkcx7DAuuPdzQrb5iVucRkl9v5agjMQ3z9c2rndaGQfgVPQopPZlosiFX38tLA.jpg" width="800" height="411" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1522</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1522</guid><pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 15:00:46 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 rssrssrssrss: 一个 feed 合并工具</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;rssrssrssrss: 一个 feed 合并工具&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/issues/119" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;投稿&lt;/a&gt;，向我们推荐了由 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1382" t